  "source_review": {
    "identity_and_capability": "PlannedBrain.start186-196 and sync_context219-229 align native epoch/identity before receipt capability capture and fresh admission. _received_context119-129 requires selected character/current life; _capabilities162-184 advertises NPC only from eligible pre-send producer.",
    "investigation_and_admission": "Playing.build_host constructs the opt-in PlannedBrain; ScheduledAgent._start_brain473-498 binds actual PlayingClient readers. PlanningRuntime._propose_job claims a physical worker and invokes actual LlmPlanner, whose tool allowlist/schema are receipt constrained. capture_job_context retains full detached current UI/receipt plus owner-isolated advice; PlanLifecycle.admit validates freshly recomputed capabilities.",
    "event_control": "PlannedBrain._install_npc231-246 triggers initial review only for a new admitted version. execution_event_allowed permits NPC received UI and Heartbeat/DamageTaken/ScriptFailed; _execution_event_key386-395 uses bounded header/version data, not duplicate full UI text. ExecutionRuntime preserves a physical pending worker and generation/version checks. CLEF continue allows the LLM-authored intent, hold emits nothing, replan invokes existing bounded planning policy; no CLEF menu authorship or legacy fallback.",
    "captured_execution_request": "execution_decisions.execution_request31-96 includes complete detached received_npc_ui and typed npc_observation for NPC, checks the unchanged 32768 UTF-8 byte ceiling, and retains untrusted-advice labels. New administrative keys do not copy UI text; existing capture/budgets remain unchanged.",
    "dispatch": "ScheduledAgent._perform_planned_npc813-828 requires current object-reference binding and the exact owner-emitted action/version/CLEF authorization before native dispatch. PlannedBrain.npc_action_current138-151 also checks current review deadline/pending work. PlayingClient._respond_npc438-464 records denied/failed/issued and retains unchanged primitive validation, one qualified observation clock/snapshot, exact intent comparison, and immediate controller request without another receive callback. perform_native remains None-returning; legacy primitives/signatures remain intact.",
    "waiting_and_progress": "NpcPhase.dispatched accepts only the exact issued action receipt. The admitted phase/barrier survives the legitimate post-request absence of an actionable observation. Actual planning_npc_ui uses controller consumption/lease failure plus current self/actor/map/epoch/opening guards; NpcPhase.observe requires a newer same-open text/next/menu. Repeated UI, cutin, peer, missing/unsupported/stale UI, exhausted UI/review deadlines and denied/failed/missing dispositions cannot establish progress. One phase cannot automatically respond to later UI.",
    "replacement": "NpcHostBinding uses client/wire/local session object references, not a new serialized domain nonce. ScheduledAgent invalidates before connect/start/close and before capture/dispatch when those references change. Equal DTO metadata cannot rescue old proposal/CLEF result/queued action/issued barrier. Physically claimed workers remain owned until joined, and unclaimed cancelled planning cannot invoke the provider.",
    "exception_and_legacy": "Actual send KeyboardInterrupt/SystemExit tests preserve exact original object/deepest frame; ordinary failed send poisons local NPC state and does not retry. Existing selected host cleanup, IDLE/REST/standing handoff, passive keepalive, capture/private isolation and model budgets remain green. No protocol/domain/source-contract relaxation was made."
  },
